# Agent edits a harness file in place inside a command substitution: the
# in-place editors count also inside `$(…)`, backticks and subshells
# (ADR-0037, ADR-0043; implementer finding F4 on 445650c)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `Cargo.toml
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "echo $(sed -i '' s/a/b/ Cargo.toml)"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
